# Taken from https://github.com/jeszyman/biotools on 2022-06-08
# Ignore hidden directories
./snake*
**/.snakemake
**/.cache
**/.config
**/.java
# --- biopipe-specific ignores (module template) ---

# Fixture logs and benchmarks go to tests/full/logs and tests/full/benchmark,
# which the tests/full/* rule below ignores.

# Pinned fixture checksums (the global gitignore ignores *.md5)
!tests/expected_outputs.md5

# Snakemake
.snakemake/

# Tangled backup files
*.org~

# --- test data (auto-managed by get_test_data.sh) ---
tests/full/*
!tests/full/inputs/
!tests/full/inputs/**
docs/superpowers/
*.org.p
*.org.pool

# org LaTeX-preview cache
ltximg/
